{"id":"f2e8f7ef-4347-4985-bbe3-834452eacc1a","title":"Slide and Shift 3","slug":"slide-and-shift-3","collectionSlug":"slide-and-shift","collectionName":"Slide and Shift","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A procedurally generated shader effect displaying a mosaic-like pattern of rectangular blocks in varying shades of green. The composition features a grid-based structure with blocks ranging from light-green (#5dd65d) to dark-green (#137b26), creating a pixelated, low-resolution aesthetic. The blocks are overlaid with a crosshatch dithering pattern using a Bayer2 matrix, which creates a textured, halftone-like appearance across the entire surface. Grid distortion is applied with moderate intensity (2.3), causing subtle warping and displacement of the block boundaries, giving the rigid grid an organic, slightly chaotic quality. The effect combines block noise generation with pixelation at 16-pixel scale, resulting in distinct rectangular regions. A vignette effect darkens the edges, particularly noticeable in the corners and periphery, creating subtle depth and drawing focus toward the center. The overall mood is digital and retro, reminiscent of 8-bit or 16-bit computer graphics with a modern shader twist. The dithering pattern adds visual complexity and texture, preventing the solid color blocks from appearing flat. The color palette is monochromatic within the green spectrum, with high contrast between light and dark regions creating visual interest and definition.","colors":["#38bb4e","#137b26","#5dd65d","#000000"],"labels":["geometric","textured","retro","dramatic"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/f2e8f7ef-4347-4985-bbe3-834452eacc1a.jpg","toneMapping":"cineon","components":[{"type":"BlockNoise","id":"idmvk9m67thm60tqcar","_key":"key_mvk9m67thm60tqcar","props":{"seed":49,"scale":1.5,"speed":0.2,"stops":[{"color":"#ffffff","position":0},{"color":"#000000","position":1}],"colorA":"#ffffff","colorB":"#000000","balance":0,"opacity":1,"contrast":4.5,